# Skip composer.phar

`composer.phar` at the repository root is the Composer binary. It is not application code.

When reading, searching, grepping, or analysing this repo:

- Do not open, index, or count `composer.phar`.
- Do not treat classes inside it as Adlexone classes.
- Point searches at application trees (`src/`, `inlay_functions/`, `layouts/`, `actions/`, `bootstrap/`) or pass an explicit exclusion.

```text
# Bad — walks the Composer binary
rg "class " .

# Good — application PHP only
rg "class " src inlay_functions layouts actions bootstrap
```
